+## Module SQL
+
+SQL files in `data/sql/db-auth`, `data/sql/db-characters` and `data/sql/db-world` are applied by the
+core's database updater when `authserver` or `worldserver` starts, after the core's own updates and
+before data loads. Each file runs once, in file name order, and modules run in name order. Applied files
+are recorded in `skyfire_db_updates` as `<module>/<file>`. The installed copy goes to
+`<prefix>/modules/<module>/data/sql`; set `Updates.ModulesSqlPath` to read another folder, for example the
+source `modules` folder. See `Updates.Modules` in `worldserver.conf.dist`.
+
 ## Required loader function
 
 Each module must implement exactly one loader function named:
